  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! - Communication &amp; Campaigning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to ensure that millions of European citizens have had the opportunity and motivation to demand change from both the public and the private sector. This contributes to the pressure on these sectors that we aim to deliver with our lobby and advocacy work, and that aims to influence the public and private sector to ensure that the interests, voices and rights of farmers and workers are represented when taking decisions in international value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
